{"id":"19-1867-8-13","zh":"快乐将被你领受：anubhavissati、anubhavissanti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-1867-14-17","zh":"anubhavissasi、anubhavissatha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-1867-18-21","zh":"anubhavissāmi、anubhavissāma。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-1867-22-27","zh":"不删除时，作 anubhūyissati、anubhūyissanti 等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-1867-28-30","zh":"后六个词尾也是这样。","confidence":70}
{"id":"19-1867-31-33","zh":"在无人称（bhāva）语态中：bhūyissati、bhūyissate。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-1868-2-6","zh":"在主动语态中：pacissati（他将煮）、pacissanti（他们将煮）等。","confidence":80}
{"id":"19-1868-7-14","zh":"在被动语态中：饭将被提婆达多煮——pacissati、pacīyissati、paccissati。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-1868-15-24","zh":"诸饭将被煮——paccissanti、pacīyissanti、pacīyissare、paccissare、paccissanti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-1869-2-8","zh":"由词根 gam，在主动语态中：他将去（so gacchissati），他们将去（te gacchissanti）。","confidence":80}
