{"id":"19-1869-25-28","zh":"gacchissase、gacchissavhe。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-1869-29-32","zh":"gacchissaṃ、gacchissāmhe。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-1869-33-37","zh":"将去天界：gamissati、gamissanti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"19-1869-38-41","zh":"gamissasi、gamissatha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-1869-42-46","zh":"gamissāmi、gamissāma 等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"19-1869-47-51","zh":"在被动语态中：gacchiyissati、gacchiyissanti 等。","confidence":80}
