{"id":"19-1883-9-17","zh":"他们曾成为：abhaviṃsu、bhaviṃsu，abhavaṃsu、bhavaṃsu，abhavuṃ、bhavuṃ。","confidence":75}
{"id":"19-1884-2-11","zh":"42. o 换为 a、i、ttha、ttho","confidence":70}
