{"id":"19-1885-7-25","zh":"abhava、bhava，abhavi、bhavi；加 iñ 增音时有 abhavittha、bhavittha，abhavattha、bhavattha，abhavittho、bhavittho，abhavattho、bhavattho。","confidence":70}
